            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.3.1

- Fixed intermittent iCloud workspace conflicts that could interrupt autosaving while writing.
- Draftava now retries transient iCloud conflicts automatically instead of immediately blocking saves.
- Duplicate iCloud file versions are safely resolved only when their contents are identical.
- Genuine conflicting versions remain protected from being overwritten.
]]></description>
